      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From start to finish, our experience with Six Star Plus was nothing short of exceptional. The sales and quoting process was smooth, transparent, and professional. They took the time to explain our options clearly, answered all our questions, and provided a competitive, well-detailed quote with no hidden surprises.The installation was just as impressive. The team was polite, punctual, and incredibly tidy—they treated our home with respect and left everything spotless. The workmanship was top-notch, and it was clear they take great pride in their work.What really stood out was the customer service. After the installation, they didn’t just pack up and leave—they helped organise the grid connection and walked us through how to use the charger properly, making sure we felt confident and informed.We highly recommend Six Star Plus to anyone looking for reliable, high-quality service. They went above and beyond at every stage, and we couldn’t be happier with the result!",
